<title>UK: NSW Treasury Corp sets A$100 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>NSW Treasury Corp sets A$100 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW SOUTH WALES TREASURY CORP</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  THE CROWN IN RIGHT OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    06.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    06.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
